      "text": "Traffic Advisory | GachibowliTrafficPS\n\nESTAH Society is organizing “RUN FOR THE FARMERS” 🏃‍♂️🌾\n 1K, 2K, 5K & 10K Run on 21.12.2025 from 05:00 AM to 09:00 AM.\n\n📍 Route:\nGachibowli Stadium → Pullela Gopichand Academy → TNGO Colony → Gachibowli Stadium\n👥 Approximately 1200 participants are expected.\n\nCommuters are advised to plan their travel accordingly and cooperate for the smooth conduct of the event.\n\n#runforthefarmers #gachibowlitraffic #trafficadvisory #cyberabadtrafficpolice #roadsafety #publicawareness",
